+ * fixed-test-payload path remains tool-less. The first real payload mounts the
+ * shipped standard preset, scopes it to a provider-neutral executor face, and
+ * keeps a monotonic guard as the final authority. The Host still owns the
+ * Worker identity; no controller identity event is added.
+ * @param hostCtx - Host context used to mount the shipped preset.
+ * @param agentCtx - the unpublished Worker agent scope.
+ * @param worker - the durable roster view that selected this capability face.
